  "title": "Prism Rainbow",
  "description": "A spectral path tracer in two dimensions: every fragment fires 16 rays at random points across the glass, refracts each one through the prism, and keeps the ones that come out aimed at the lamp. Temporal accumulation turns that noise into a rainbow.",
